Now I have enough data to write the review. Let me synthesize my findings.

**Key verification results:**
- All cited papers confirmed real: DICE ✓, Self-Critique ✓, CoDeC ✓, No Memorization No Detection ✓, Kocyigit et al. ✓, Probe-Based Data Attribution ✓, How Much Can We Forget (ICML 2025) ✓, FILA ✓
- EMNLP 2026 May 25 deadline confirmed ✓; binding venue selection confirmed ✓
- OLMo-2-0425-1B on HuggingFace (Apache 2.0) confirmed ✓
- No concurrent work on stage attribution found (searched multiple keyword variants)
- RADAR (arXiv:2510.08931) uses activation features for recall vs. reasoning detection but no stage attribution
- "Unpublished mechanistic work (pending arXiv)" from Round 2 CRITICAL issue is **still present** in Round 3 proposal

